    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know it might \"interact\" but how much of a big deal is it really? i feel totally fine. i just dont want to keep bugging my doctor for every little thing since they're always so busy. like is it really gonna make the warfarin stop working entirely or is it just a minor thing?",
